{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "DevSecOps Copilot",
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "informationUri": "https://example.com/devsecops-copilot",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "SEC001",
              "name": "AWS access key committed to source",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "AWS access key committed to source"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An AWS access key ID was found. Anyone with repo access can use it to reach your cloud account."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Revoke the key in AWS IAM immediately, move it to a secrets manager (AWS Secrets Manager / Vault) and read it from an environment variable.\n\nألغِ المفتاح فوراً من AWS IAM، وانقله إلى مدير أسرار (AWS Secrets Manager أو Vault)، واقرأه من متغير بيئة."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "secrets"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SEC003",
              "name": "Hardcoded API key / token",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Hardcoded API key / token"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A credential-like value is hardcoded in the source."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Load secrets from environment variables or a secrets manager; rotate the exposed value.\n\nحمّل الأسرار من متغيرات البيئة أو مدير أسرار، واستبدل القيمة المكشوفة."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "secrets"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SEC004",
              "name": "Hardcoded password",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Hardcoded password"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A password appears to be hardcoded."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use environment variables / a vault and rotate the password.\n\nاستخدم متغيرات البيئة أو Vault، وغيّر كلمة المرور."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "secrets"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "INJ001",
              "name": "SQL query built from string concatenation",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "SQL query built from string concatenation"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "User input concatenated into SQL can lead to SQL injection."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use parameterised queries, e.g. cursor.execute(\"... WHERE id = %s\", (user_id,)).\n\nاستخدم الاستعلامات المُعلَّمة (Parameterized)، مثل: cursor.execute(\"... WHERE id = %s\", (user_id,))."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "injection"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "INJ003",
              "name": "OS command execution via shell",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OS command execution via shell"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Passing input to a shell enables command injection."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use argument lists without a shell (subprocess.run([...], shell=False)) and validate input.\n\nمرّر الأوامر كقائمة دون Shell (subprocess.run([...], shell=False)) وتحقّق من المدخلات."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "injection"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CRY001",
              "name": "Weak hashing algorithm (MD5/SHA-1)",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Weak hashing algorithm (MD5/SHA-1)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "MD5 and SHA-1 are broken for security purposes."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use SHA-256+ for integrity, and bcrypt/argon2 for passwords.\n\nاستخدم SHA-256 أو أعلى للتحقق من السلامة، وbcrypt أو argon2 لكلمات المرور."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "crypto"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "TLS001",
              "name": "TLS certificate verification disabled",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "TLS certificate verification disabled"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Disabling certificate checks allows man-in-the-middle attacks."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Keep verification on; trust internal CAs via a CA bundle instead.\n\nأبقِ التحقق مفعّلاً، وأضف شهادة الجهة الداخلية (CA bundle) عند الحاجة."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "tls"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CFG001",
              "name": "Debug mode enabled",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Debug mode enabled"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Debug mode can leak stack traces and enable interactive consoles in production."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Drive debug from an environment variable and default it to false.\n\nاجعل وضع التصحيح يُضبط من متغير بيئة، وقيمته الافتراضية false."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "config"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DES001",
              "name": "Unsafe deserialization",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unsafe deserialization"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Deserializing untrusted data can execute arbitrary code."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use JSON or yaml.safe_load; never unpickle untrusted data.\n\nاستخدم JSON أو yaml.safe_load، ولا تفك تسلسل pickle من مصدر غير موثوق."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "deserialization"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CON001",
              "name": "Container runs as root",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Container runs as root"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Dockerfile has no non-root USER instruction."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Add a dedicated user: RUN adduser -D app && USER app\n\nأضف مستخدماً مخصصاً: RUN adduser -D app ثم USER app"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "container"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CON002",
              "name": "Base image uses :latest or no tag",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Base image uses :latest or no tag"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unpinned base images make builds non-reproducible and can pull vulnerable versions."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Pin to a version or digest, e.g. python:3.12-slim@sha256:...\n\nثبّت الإصدار أو البصمة، مثل python:3.12-slim@sha256:..."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "container"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.0"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DEP001",
              "name": "Unpinned dependency",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unpinned dependency"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Dependencies without exact versions weaken supply-chain control and SBOM accuracy."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Pin exact versions and use a lock file (requirements.txt with ==, package-lock.json).\n\nثبّت الإصدارات بدقة واستخدم ملف قفل (== في requirements.txt أو package-lock.json)."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "supply_chain"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.0"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CFG002",
              "name": "CORS allows any origin (*)",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CORS allows any origin (*)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Wildcard CORS lets any website call your API from a user's browser."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Allow-list the specific trusted origins.\n\nحدّد قائمة صريحة بالنطاقات الموثوقة فقط."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "config"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "XSS001",
              "name": "Possible DOM XSS sink",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Possible DOM XSS sink"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Writing untrusted data as HTML enables cross-site scripting."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use textContent or sanitize with DOMPurify.\n\nاستخدم textContent أو نظّف المحتوى بمكتبة DOMPurify."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "xss"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.5"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "SEC001",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "AWS access key committed to source | مفتاح وصول AWS مكشوف في الكود | Controls: NCA_ECC: 2-2, 2-7, 1-6; CRA: AnnexI-I(2)(d), AnnexI-I(2)(e); NIS2: Art.21(2)(i), Art.21(2)(e); DORA: Art.9; GDPR: Art.32"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "app.py"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 11
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "SEC003",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Hardcoded API key / token | مفتاح API أو رمز وصول مكتوب مباشرة في الكود | Controls: NCA_ECC: 2-2, 2-7, 1-6; CRA: AnnexI-I(2)(d), AnnexI-I(2)(e); NIS2: Art.21(2)(i), Art.21(2)(e); DORA: Art.9; GDPR: Art.32"
          },
          "locations": [
